    "common.snooze_affordability" : {
      "comment" : "Balance hint under the wallet balance and in the alarms-list sticky header: how many snoozes the remaining balance still buys. A plural VARIATION rather than the flat plural.* nouns, because this call site owns the whole phrase - see example.days_count in this file. common.* because it appears on two screens.",
